    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF FUTURES AND OPTIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程理論與實務並重, 主要內容包括期貨市場的基本交易流程、交易的成本 、避險、投機交易、與價差交易。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the theory and practice of futures trading, including trading process, hedging ,speculation, and futures and option spread trading strategy.",
